Z||000010||cstevens||05-22-2001||12:54 PM||||arrghh not as easy as it first looked, although my problems may be compounded by two things- I never worked on a fiero before and both fieros are 4spd cars.<P> 1- nothing bolts up(i cut off the brackets off the lumina subframe and welded them to the fiero subframe)<P> 2- Power steering pump (need it for belt system - Im gonna loop the two lines together and let it pump happily away<P> 3- shifter - Did they ever make a 4spd auto fiero?<BR>  Anyhow after three days of grunting im about ready to bolt the subframe in An Mr frosty is correct its gonna look spiffy in there once i clean it all up||||reg||8
